@api = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Ask for an OTP (Mock mode returns devCode)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mobile": "9876543210", "role": "Customer" }

### 2. Verify it (paste the devCode) and copy the token
POST {{api}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mobile": "9876543210", "code": "123456", "role": "Customer" }

### 3. Catalogue (no sign-in needed)
GET {{api}}/api/catalog
